			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-1690285">
									

<p>So this was an attempt by some Native Americans to weaponize a Wendigo for use against those who had taken their land? If so, shouldn't the thing be hostile towards those who look Caucasian, rather than those who speak English or French?</p>
